## Describe your changes

Add AML resource support for data configs. This config works now:
```
    "data_configs": {
        "dataset_default": {
            "name": "dataset_default",
            "type": "HuggingfaceContainer",
            "params_config": {
                "data_name": "name", 
                "data_dir": {
                    "type": "azureml_datastore",
                    "config": {
                        "azureml_client": {
                            "subscription_id": "<>",
                            "resource_group": "<>",
                            "workspace_name": "<>"
                        },
                        "datastore_name": "<datastore_name>",
                        "relative_path": "<path/data>"
                    }
                },
                "component_kwargs": {
                    "pre_process_data": {...}
                }
            }
        }
    }
```

This AML data can be used both in local and on AML.

